    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apt. 1 Inbhear Mews (approx. 46 sqm) is a 2-bedroom ground floor apartment ideally located in a central and convenient location within walking distance of all amenities in Arklow Town.\r\nThe property offers practical accommodation throughout, comprising an entrance hallway, an open plan living/kitchen area, two bedrooms, and a bathroom. The kitchen features fitted units with integrated oven and hob, while the bathroom includes a corner shower unit with pump shower. A rear door provides direct access to the back of the property, where off-street parking is available.\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some refurbishment and modernisation, it offers excellent potential for investors, downsizers, or first-time buyers seeking a centrally located home.\r\nInbhear Mews is a well-established residential development close to shops, supermarkets, schools, public transport, Bridgewater Shopping Centre, the beach, harbour, and a wide range of local amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Hallway\r\n1.01m x 1.71m\r\nWooden floors\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n5.59m x 3.08m\r\nWooden floors. Open plan living room/kitchen. Rear door access\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.53m x 2.51m\r\nTiled floors. Fitted kitchen. Integrated oven/hob. Extractor fan\r\nRear door access with off-street parking to rear of property\r\n\r\nHallway\r\n1.89m x 0.82m\r\nWooden floors\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.56m x 2.68m\r\nWooden floors\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.86m x 2.91m\r\nWooden floors\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.77m x 1.27m\r\nTiled floors. Half tiled walls. WHB. WC. Corner shower unit with pump shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Eircode Y14 H272\r\nApprox. 46 sqm / 503 sq. ft\r\nGround floor apartment\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nOpen plan living / kitchen area\r\nOff-street parking to rear\r\nCentral town location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3 BER No.106641475 Energy Performance Indicator:217.12 kWh/m²/yr"
      }
    ],
